35,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"@Shizue, the station block is still fighting over a broken latch! And nobody wants to be the enforcer. We need a system that doesn’t force us to police each other.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, I see. The truck comes before we wake, and one household filed most complaints. We must find a rhythm that respects everyone’s morning.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Shizue, the clerk says permanent builds need four months and five signatures. The ledger shows thirty-four thousand yen yearly on open bags. We must quantify the actual hours this takes.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,"@Shizue, eleven complaints from one house? That’s not fair! I found the narrowest frontage is only ninety centimetres. We can’t just leave it there!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, thirty-four thousand yen yearly is a real burden. @Rin, ninety centimetres is a trap. We must ensure the new plan distributes the actual workload fairly, not just the cost.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, ninety centimetres is a nightmare! But the real danger is us stopping talking. We need a spot that lets us still knock on each other’s doors.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Rin, I hear your frustration. But the truck comes before we wake. We need a spot that keeps the morning quiet for everyone, not just the loudest voice.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, ninety centimetres is a trap. The ledger proves the current setup fails. We must ensure the new plan distributes the actual workload fairly, not just the cost.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, exactly! If one house has the mess at their gate, they’re stuck with the smell and the noise. I want a plan where everyone shares the burden equally!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, I agree. But fairness is not just about space; it is about the ledger. We must ensure the costs do not fall hardest on those with the least room.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Asuka, four months of paperwork sounds exhausting. But if we can’t talk without fighting, the new spot is just a new place to resent each other.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, I understand. But if the truck comes before we wake, we need a spot that keeps the morning quiet for everyone. Let’s find a rhythm that respects our sleep.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, four months is a trap. The ledger shows thirty-four thousand yen wasted on open bags. We need a system that minimizes the actual hours we spend maintaining it.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Kenji, I get it! But if we just move the mess, the same house might get stuck again. I want a plan where nobody is the permanent victim!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, I understand your worry. But we must first understand the financial reality. I will examine the ward subsidy and the block ledger to see our true burden.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, I hear you on the money. But if we can’t talk without fighting, the new spot is just a new place to resent each other. Let’s keep the doors open.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, I agree. A quiet morning is peace. Let’s find a spot where we can still smile at each other, not just avoid the mess.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, I agree. But we must quantify the hours. I will examine the ward filing requirements and the block ledger to verify the actual administrative burden.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Kenji, I agree! But we need to make sure the new spot doesn’t just move the unfairness. I want a plan where everyone shares the burden equally!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
